{"title": "Kviz o koži | Sestavite svoj osebni načrt seruma | Tava Labs", "description": "Odgovorite na nekaj hitrih vprašanj in sestavite svoj osebni načrt okoli izdelka PDRN Brightening Serum. En serum, dvakrat na dan, prilagojen vaši koži in vašim ciljem.", "contentHtml": "\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <header class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"wordmark\">TAVA<small>LABS</small></div>\n    <span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);\">PDRN Brightening Serum</span>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"progress-zone\" id=\"progressZone\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"progress-meta\">\n      <button class=\"backbtn\" id=\"backBtn\" type=\"button\">&larr; Nazaj</button>\n      <span id=\"stepLabel\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bar\"><div id=\"barFill\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 1 · HOOK -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"hook\" data-progress=\"6\" data-step-label=\"6 vprašanj do vašega načrta\">\n    <img class=\"bottle\" src=\"§IMG0§\" alt=\"Steklenička izdelka PDRN Brightening Serum družbe Tava Labs\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Ustvarite svoj osebni 30-dnevni načrt</p>\n    <h1>En serum. Dvakrat na dan. <em>30 dni.</em></h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Odgovorite na nekaj hitrih vprašanj in ustvarili bomo vaš osebni 30-dnevni načrt okoli PDRN Brightening Serum, en korak zjutraj in en korak zvečer. Naročnina, ki jo lahko kadar koli prekinete ali prekličete.</p>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Sestavi moj načrt</button>\n    <p class=\"note\">PDRN Brightening Serum · 1 fl oz (30 ml) · Narejen za uporabo dvakrat na dan</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 2 · Q1 GOAL -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"goal\" data-progress=\"14\" data-step-label=\"Še 6\">\n    <h2>Kaj si najbolj želite od naslednjih 30 dni?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"goal\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"radiance\"><span class=\"t\">Svetlejša koža na videz</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"fine_lines\"><span class=\"t\">Drobne gubice</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"hydration\"><span class=\"t\">Globoka hidracija</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"even_tone\"><span class=\"t\">Enakomeren ton</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 3 · INTERSTITIAL 1 -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"notalone\" data-progress=\"24\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Niste sami</p>\n    <h2 id=\"naTitle\">Niste sami.</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" id=\"naBody\"></p>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Nadaljujte</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 4 · Q2 SKIN TYPE -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"skinType\" data-progress=\"34\" data-step-label=\"Še 5\">\n    <h2>Kako se vaša koža običajno počuti do sredine dneva?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"skinType\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dry\"><span class=\"t\">Suha</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"oily\"><span class=\"t\">Mastna</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"combination\"><span class=\"t\">Mešana</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"sensitive\"><span class=\"t\">Občutljiva</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"not_sure\"><span class=\"t\">Nisem prepričan</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 5 · Q3 CONCERN -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"concern\" data-progress=\"46\" data-step-label=\"Še 4\">\n    <h2>In kaj vas trenutno najbolj skrbi?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"concern\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dullness\"><span class=\"t\">Pustost</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"fine_lines\"><span class=\"t\">Drobne gubice</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"uneven_tone\"><span class=\"t\">Neenakomeren ton</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"texture\"><span class=\"t\">Hrapava tekstura</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dryness\"><span class=\"t\">Suhost</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 6 · INTERSTITIAL 2 · FORMULA MATCH -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"match\" data-progress=\"56\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Vaše ujemanje formule</p>\n    <h2>V steklenički, prilagojeno vašim odgovorom</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">Ena fiksna formula. Tukaj je, katere sestavine ustrezajo temu, kar ste nam pravkar povedali.</p>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" id=\"matchBox\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Nadaljujte</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 7 · Q4 SENSITIVITY -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"sensitivity\" data-progress=\"64\" data-step-label=\"Še 3\">\n    <h2>Je vaša koža že reagirala na močne izdelke?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"sensitivity\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"often\"><span class=\"t\">Da, zlahka</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"sometimes\"><span class=\"t\">Včasih</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"never\"><span class=\"t\">Redko</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 8 · Q5 ROUTINE -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"routine\" data-progress=\"74\" data-step-label=\"Še 2\">\n    <h2>Kako je videti vaša rutina danes?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"routine\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"cleanser_only\"><span class=\"t\">Samo čistilo</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"few_products\"><span class=\"t\">Nekaj izdelkov</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"full_routine\"><span class=\"t\">Popolna rutina</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 9 · Q6 ROUTINE TIMES -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"times\" data-progress=\"84\" data-step-label=\"Zadnje vprašanje\">\n    <h2>Kdaj ga boste nanesli?</h2>\n    <label class=\"f\">Zjutraj</label>\n    <div class=\"chips\" data-time-chips=\"amTime\">\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"06:30\">6:30 AM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"07:30\">7:30 AM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"08:30\">8:30 AM</button>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"time\" id=\"amCustom\" aria-label=\"Poljuben jutranji čas\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    <label class=\"f\">Zvečer</label>\n    <div class=\"chips\" data-time-chips=\"pmTime\">\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"21:00\">9:00 PM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"22:00\">10:00 PM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"22:30\">10:30 PM</button>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"time\" id=\"pmCustom\" aria-label=\"Poljuben večerni čas\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    <div style=\"height:22px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Nadaljujte</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 10 · EMAIL -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"email\" data-progress=\"92\" data-step-label=\"Skoraj ste tam\">\n    <h2>Kam naj pošljemo vaš 30-dnevni načrt?</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Vaš načrt gre v vaš nabiralnik. Pri prenosu aplikacije uporabite isto e-pošto, ker tako vas bo aplikacija prepoznala, vaši odgovori, načrt in naročilo pa bodo čakali tam.</p>\n    <label class=\"f\" for=\"emailInput\">E-poštni naslov</label>\n    <input type=\"email\" id=\"emailInput\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n    <div class=\"banner err\" id=\"emailErr\">Ta e-pošta ne izgleda popolna. Preverite jo in poskusite znova.</div>\n    <div style=\"height:18px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" id=\"emailNext\">Pokaži moj načrt</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 11 · PLAN REVEAL — treatment preview -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"plan\" data-progress=\"97\" data-step-label=\"Vaš načrt\">\n    <div class=\"planhero\">\n      <p class=\"plan-eyebrow\">Predogled vaše nege</p>\n      <p class=\"plan-brand\">Tava Labs</p>\n      <h2 id=\"planTitle\">PDRN Brightening Serum</h2>\n      <div class=\"plan-bottle\"><img src=\"/assets/products/pdrn-bright-serum/view-1-mockup.jpg\" alt=\"PDRN Brightening Serum bottle\"></div>\n      <p class=\"basedon\">Izbrano na podlagi vaših ciljev:</p>\n      <div class=\"goalchips\" id=\"goalChips\"></div>\n      <p class=\"priceline\">Načrti že od <strong>$39/month*</strong></p>\n      <p class=\"fineprint\">*Plačilo mesečno. Kadar koli začasno ustavite ali prekličete.<br>Enkratna steklenička $49.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n        <p style=\"font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#B78B45;margin:0 0 8px\">VAŠ PRVI TEDEN</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px\">Vaši odgovori so že začrtali vaš prvi teden rutine. Po prvih dveh dneh ostane še pet dni, prvi dan pa se začne v trenutku, ko je vaš serum odposlan.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;background:#123B2C;color:#D8C19A;font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">1. dan</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;background:#123B2C;color:#D8C19A;font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">2. dan</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">3. dan</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">4. dan</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">5. dan</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">6. dan</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">7. dan</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cardbox detailscard\">\n      <h3>Podrobnosti seruma</h3>\n      <p>En serum. Dvakrat na dan. 30 dni.</p>\n      <div class=\"stats\">\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Vrsta</span><span class=\"sv\">Serum za posvetlitev · 1 fl oz</span></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Uporaba</span><span class=\"sv\">Dvakrat na dan</span></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Načrt</span><span class=\"sv\">30 dni</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"planBox\"></div>\n      <details class=\"acc\" open>\n        <summary>Aktivne sestavine</summary>\n        <div class=\"ingcards\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Aktivne sestavine\">\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">PDRN</span><span class=\"sub\">Polideoksiribonukleotid</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-pdrn.png\" alt=\"Tekstura seruma PDRN\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Za svetlejšo kožo na videz</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Acetyl Hexapeptide-8</span><span class=\"sub\">Peptid</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-peptide.png\" alt=\"Tekstura seruma Acetyl Hexapeptide-8\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Za kožo gladkejšega videza</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Sodium Hyaluronate</span><span class=\"sub\">Hialuronska kislina</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-ha.png\" alt=\"Tekstura seruma Sodium Hyaluronate\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Za globoko hidracijo</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Panthenol</span><span class=\"sub\">Provitamin B5</span><div class=\"ingtex\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"benefit\">Za mehko, udobno kožo</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"ingnote\">Kozmetični serum za lokalno uporabo. Samo za zunanjo uporabo. Izogibajte se očem. Če pride do draženja, prenehajte z uporabo.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"acc\">\n        <summary>Kako uporabljati</summary>\n        <p>Nanesite 2 do 4 črpalke na čisto, suho kožo, dvakrat na dan. Zjutraj nadaljujte z vlažilno kremo ali kremo za sončenje.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"acc\">\n        <summary>Dobro je vedeti</summary>\n        <p>Samo za zunanjo uporabo. Izogibajte se očem. Če pride do draženja, prenehajte z uporabo. Hranite zunaj dosega otrok. Ne uporabljajte na poškodovani koži. Hranite na hladnem in suhem mestu.</p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"featureband\">\n      <h3>Spoznajte svoj <em>serum</em></h3>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/products/pdrn-bright-serum/view-1-mockup.jpg\" alt=\"Steklenička izdelka PDRN Brightening Serum\">\n        <span class=\"callout c1\">Predstavitev in svetlost</span>\n        <span class=\"callout c2\">Globoka hidracija</span>\n        <span class=\"callout c3\">Drobne gubice</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"featuretitle\">Resnični rezultati</h3>\n    <div class=\"results\">\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/D0DBB2D8-601B-46E8-BE29-A068C5DAF345.jpeg\" alt=\"Pred in po z izdelkom PDRN Brightening Serum\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Pred</span><span>Po</span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/IMG_3056.jpeg\" alt=\"Pred in po z izdelkom PDRN Brightening Serum\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Pred</span><span>Po</span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/IMG_3057.jpeg\" alt=\"Pred in po z izdelkom PDRN Brightening Serum\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Pred</span><span>Po</span></figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"resultsnote\">Posamezni rezultati se razlikujejo.</p>\n    <div class=\"stickybar\">\n      <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Nadaljujte s tem načrtom</button>\n      <button class=\"altlink\" type=\"button\" data-next>Oglejte si druge možnosti</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 12 · OFFER + CHECKOUT -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"checkout\" data-progress=\"99\" data-step-label=\"Blagajna\">\n    <h2>Začnite svojih 30 dni</h2>\n    <div class=\"banner demo\" id=\"demoBanner\" hidden><strong>Predstavitvena blagajna. Brez stroškov.</strong> Ta stran še ni povezana s končno točko za plačila ali izpolnjevanje naročil. Spodnji gumb preveri vaše podatke in sestavi natančen tovor naročila, tako da lahko vidite, kaj bi bilo poslano.</div>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"purchaseType\" data-no-advance=\"1\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"subscribe\"><span class=\"price\">$39</span><span class=\"t\">Naročite se in prihranite</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"one_time\"><span class=\"price\">$49</span><span class=\"t\">Enkratno</span></button>\n    </div>\n    <form id=\"shipForm\" novalidate>\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"firstName\">Ime</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"firstName\" autocomplete=\"given-name\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"lastName\">Priimek</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"lastName\" autocomplete=\"family-name\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"address1\">Ulični naslov</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"address1\" autocomplete=\"street-address\">\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"address2\">Stanovanje, apartma itd. <span class=\"opt\">(neobvezno)</span></label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"address2\" autocomplete=\"address-line2\">\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"city\">Mesto</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"city\" autocomplete=\"address-level2\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"stateCode\">Zvezna država</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"stateCode\" autocomplete=\"address-level1\" placeholder=\"CA\" maxlength=\"2\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"zip\">Poštna številka</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"zip\" autocomplete=\"postal-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"countryCode\">Država</label>\n          <select id=\"countryCode\"><option value=\"US\" selected>Združene države Amerike</option><option value=\"CA\">Kanada</option><option value=\"GB\">Združeno kraljestvo</option><option value=\"AU\">Avstralija</option></select>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"phone\">Telefon <span class=\"opt\">(neobvezno, za obvestila o dostavi)</span></label>\n      <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" autocomplete=\"tel\">\n      <div class=\"banner err\" id=\"shipErr\"></div>\n      <div style=\"height:20px\"></div>\n      <button class=\"cta\" type=\"submit\" id=\"buyBtn\">Začni mojo naročnino, $39</button>\n      <p class=\"note\" id=\"payNote\">Naročnina se podaljša vsakih 30 dni za $39. Kadar koli začasno ustavite ali prekličete.</p>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 13 · THANK YOU -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"thanks\">\n    <img class=\"bottle\" src=\"§IMG1§\" alt=\"Steklenička izdelka PDRN Brightening Serum družbe Tava Labs\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Naročilo prejeto</p>\n    <h2>Vaš načrt<em>se začne zdaj.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"banner demo\" id=\"thanksDemo\" hidden><strong>Predstavitvena blagajna. Noben strošek ni bil zaračunan.</strong> Tovor vašega naročila je bil shranjen v tem brskalniku, tako da lahko natančno pregledate, kaj bo poslala različica v živo.</div>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" id=\"thanksBox\"></div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;\">Vaš nakup se prikaže v aplikaciji</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">Vaš načrt živi v aplikaciji Tava, z dnevnimi odkljukavanji zjutraj in zvečer ter vašim nizom in sledenjem vaši pošiljki. Aplikacija še ni v trgovini App Store. Po blagajni vam potrditvena stran in e-pošta dasta <strong>kodo za prevzem</strong>. Ko namestite aplikacijo, se prijavite in vnesite to kodo, vaš načrt, odgovori in naročilo pa so že tam. Ni treba znova kupovati.</p>\n    <!-- The app is not published yet, so there is deliberately no store\n         button here. The claim code on checkout/success.html (and in the\n         confirmation email) is the handoff. Add the real App Store link\n         next to the claim code once the app is listed. -->\n    <a class=\"cta\" href=\"/checkout/success\" id=\"appStoreBtn\">Oglejte si mojo kodo za prevzem po blagajni</a>\n    <p class=\"note\" id=\"carryLine\"></p>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>Tava Labs · PDRN Brightening Serum za ustanovitelje · Vprašanja? talia@tavalabs.app</footer>\n</div>\n\n\n"}